Description: A modified version of the janitor package with enhanced 
    visualization and automated cleaning features. Based on the 
    original janitor package by Sam Firke (https://github.com/sfirke/janitor).
    This package adds interactive dashboards, automated cleaning pipelines,
    and comprehensive data health visualization.
